  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/983cd9f3e84a0f8bef890c6968a7f0fffcb235d2.png\" alt=\"优化。清晰。精准\"></p><div style=\"text-align:center\"><em>通过专为竞技优化的材质包提升PvP体验，显著增强战斗清晰度</em></div><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcreativecommons.org%252flicenses%252fby-nc-sa%252f4.0%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/license-CC_BY--NC--SA_4.0-blue.svg\" alt=\"许可证\"></a></p><hr><div><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/crystal-pvp-tweaks\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/curseforge_vector.svg&amp;n=-1\" alt=\"CurseForge下载\" height=\"40\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fcrystal-pvp-tweaks\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth下载\" width=\"164\" height=\"56\"></a></div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><h3><strong>环境优化</strong></h3><ul>\n<li><strong>矿石边框</strong></li>\n</ul><h3><strong>模型优化</strong></h3><ul>\n<li><strong>缩小版剑与工具</strong> 提升视野可见度</li>\n<li><strong>紧凑型食物物品</strong>（金苹果、胡萝卜等所有可食用物品）</li>\n<li><strong>缩小手持方块尺寸</strong></li>\n<li><strong>小型盾牌</strong></li>\n<li><strong>紧凑型药水瓶</strong> 保持清晰可见</li>\n</ul><h3><strong>视觉干扰消除</strong></h3><ul>\n<li><strong>移除火焰遮挡层</strong></li>\n<li><strong>消除爆炸与锤击粒子效果</strong></li>\n<li><strong>移除南瓜头遮挡效果</strong></li>\n</ul><h3><strong>音频净化调整</strong></h3><ul>\n<li><strong>禁用爆炸音效</strong></li>\n</ul><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>物品尺寸重设</strong></p><div><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/3UNyeKHE/images/dd196e3440a5ff260b5f16190bc44ba910125cf0.png\" width=\"45%\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/3UNyeKHE/images/88efc06e804aac5df374e9ba1c70ed07852c5803.png\" width=\"45%\"></div><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>截图展示</strong></p><div><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/3UNyeKHE/images/c4d6a2459c50ac947f8d5e4c8b1a9a98c2968645.png\" width=\"100%\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/3UNyeKHE/images/b551ca2b7b3e2a96bd0d111681aed06a7a432af4.png\" width=\"100%\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/3UNyeKHE/images/ebab023cdc10ffd88d1ff3c7685c80588a7311ed.png\" width=\"100%\"></div><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>支持反馈</strong></p><div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fforms.gle%252fPedX3xVaaxRXQRQj9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">点击此处提交反馈</a></div>",
